{"id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable-approximation.md","title":"统一可计算近似与稳定模","display":"df-computable-approximation — 统一可计算近似与稳定模","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable-approximation","aliases":["20-df-computable-approximation"],"display":"df-computable-approximation — 统一可计算近似与稳定模","chapter":"3","section":"3.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 3.5.3–3.5.4","source_pdf_pages":[101],"source_printed_pages":[65],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-approximation — 统一可计算近似与稳定模"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 3.5.3–3.5.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>101</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>65</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(g:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为全可计算函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}approximation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ng\\rightsquigarrow f\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\ \\exists s\\\n\\forall t\\ge s\\ [g(x,t)=f(x)],\\\\\nm_g(x):=\\mu s\\ \\forall t\\ge s\\ [g(x,t)=g(x,s)]\n\\quad(g\\rightsquigarrow f).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}approximation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ng\\rightsquigarrow f\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\ \\exists s\\\n\\forall t\\ge s\\ [g(x,t)=f(x)],\\\\\nm_g(x):=\\mu s\\ \\forall t\\ge s\\ [g(x,t)=g(x,s)]\n\\quad(g\\rightsquigarrow f).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>稳定模只在逐点最终稳定时定义；稳定点不一定能在枚举过程中有效识别。两变量统一可计算比“每个阶段各自可计算”更强。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 3.5.3–3.5.4；印刷页 65；PDF 第 101 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g:\\omega^2\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}approximation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ng\\rightsquigarrow f\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\ \\exists s\\\n\\forall t\\ge s\\ [g(x,t)=f(x)],\\\\\nm_g(x):=\\mu s\\ \\forall t\\ge s\\ [g(x,t)=g(x,s)]\n\\quad(g\\rightsquigarrow f).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"0bf7676225746ee2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-teq]]。"},{"id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。"},{"id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"858d5de23691d48d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。"},{"id":"d4ca35593c6aba92","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"d1590e1a5b9442b9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"2f10383b8be6f0dd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]] — 章 3；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e"]}